{
  "_note": "Which source files each E2E lane actually covers. A lane is skipped only when every file matching its globs is byte-identical to the last green run (and it was green). `default` is deliberately the safe superset: an unmapped or newly added spec runs whenever any source changed, so a new lane can never be silently skipped.",
